  💭 How many bytes at *at* repeat bytes that came before, 3 to 258, or 0 when no three
  💭 do. How far back they are is 🛣 afterwards. The place is remembered on the way out.
  💭
  💭 The walk is bounded: eight places are looked at and no more, so that input in which
  💭 every place has the same number costs about what any other input costs.
  💭
  💭 A place's link is written over by the place 32,768 after it, which shares its slot.
  💭 That one is never before *at* for a place within reach of *at*, so no link that is
  💭 read here has been written over. Every place is compared all the same: places with
  💭 one number need not begin with the same bytes.
